Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:59:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1457/1463] HERESY 1538: no dropdown on a DAW lane. A stem's
 version is a button: a click steps to the next, so two versions are compared
 as it plays; a right-click opens the strip's devices with its versions as
 chips. The select stays hidden underneath, read and written as before. The
 master's devices draw a goniometer: mid up, side across. Catalogs x11; suite
 1538.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
